<title>FRANCE: Kuhne &amp; Nagel to open Strasbourg office.</title>
<headline>Kuhne &amp; Nagel to open Strasbourg office.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forwarding agents, Kuhne &amp; Nagel, said it planned to open an air cargo office at Strasbourg early next year.</p>
<p>&quot;The opening in Strasbourg will take our network of French air cargo offices to six, the others being  at Paris/CDG, Lille, Rennes, Lyon and Toulouse,&quot; a Paris-based Kuhne &amp; Nagel air cargo official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The decision to locate an office in Strasbourg had been &quot;customer-led,&quot; the official added.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
